# Engineering

- Branch from `develop`; never commit directly to `main` or `develop`.
- Every meaningful change goes through a PR with CI green.
- Do not invent GCP project IDs, domains, or secrets — use placeholders and document manual setup.
- Do not claim deployments succeeded without verification.
- Match existing patterns in `backend/app` and `frontend/`.
- Update tests when behavior changes; update docs when architecture or workflow changes.
- Minimize scope — no unnecessary dependencies or microservices.
- Preserve AI layout under `backend/app/ai/` (versioned prompts, not buried strings).
- Run backend `ruff`, `mypy`, `pytest` and frontend lint/typecheck/build before declaring work complete.
